{"page":32,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:203","surah":2,"ayah":203,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ فِىٓ أَيَّامٍ مَّعْدُودَٰتٍ ۚ فَمَن تَعَجَّلَ فِى يَوْمَيْنِ فَلَآ إِثْمَ عَلَيْهِ وَمَن تَأَخَّرَ فَلَآ إِثْمَ عَلَيْهِ ۚ لِمَنِ ٱتَّقَىٰ ۗ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّكُمْ إِلَيْهِ تُحْشَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember God on the appointed days. If anyone is in a hurry to leave after two days, there is no blame on him, nor is there any blame on anyone who stays on, so long as they are mindful of God. Be mindful of God, and remember that you will be gathered to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"during","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","en_gloss":"days","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّعْدُودَٰتٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"numbered","transliteration":"maʿdūdātin","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"Then (he) who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَعَجَّلَ","en_gloss":"hurries","transliteration":"taʿajjala","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَوْمَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two days","transliteration":"yawmayni","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلَآ","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِثْمَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"ith'ma","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَأَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"delays","transliteration":"ta-akhara","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَلَآ","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِثْمَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"ith'ma","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"upon him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِمَنِ","en_gloss":"for (the one) who","transliteration":"limani","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱتَّقَىٰ ۗ","en_gloss":"fears","transliteration":"ittaqā","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"that you","transliteration":"annakum","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":24,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"unto Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":25,"ar":"تُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be gathered","transliteration":"tuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"2:203"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٢٠٣","en_gloss":"(203)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:203"}]},{"verse_key":"2:204","surah":2,"ayah":204,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يُعْجِبُكَ قَوْلُهُۥ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَيُشْهِدُ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ مَا فِى قَلْبِهِۦ وَهُوَ أَلَدُّ ٱلْخِصَامِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is [a kind of] man whose views on the life of this world may please you [Prophet], he even calls on God to witness what is in his heart, yet he is the bitterest of opponents.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And of","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is the one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُعْجِبُكَ","en_gloss":"pleases you","transliteration":"yuʿ'jibuka","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"(with) his speech","transliteration":"qawluhu","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيُشْهِدُ","en_gloss":"and he calls to witness","transliteration":"wayush'hidu","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَلْبِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his heart","transliteration":"qalbihi","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَدُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the most quarrelsome","transliteration":"aladdu","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْخِصَامِ","en_gloss":"(of) opponents","transliteration":"l-khiṣāmi","verse_key":"2:204"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٢٠٤","en_gloss":"(204)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:204"}]},{"verse_key":"2:205","surah":2,"ayah":205,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا تَوَلَّىٰ سَعَىٰ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ لِيُفْسِدَ فِيهَا وَيُهْلِكَ ٱلْحَرْثَ وَٱلنَّسْلَ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْفَسَادَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When he leaves, he sets out to spread corruption in the land, destroying crops and live-stock- God does not like corruption.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَوَلَّىٰ","en_gloss":"he turns away","transliteration":"tawallā","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَعَىٰ","en_gloss":"he strives","transliteration":"saʿā","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِيُفْسِدَ","en_gloss":"to spread corruption","transliteration":"liyuf'sida","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"[in it]","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيُهْلِكَ","en_gloss":"and destroys","transliteration":"wayuh'lika","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْحَرْثَ","en_gloss":"the crops","transliteration":"l-ḥartha","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلنَّسْلَ ۗ","en_gloss":"and progeny","transliteration":"wal-nasla","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْفَسَادَ","en_gloss":"[the] corruption","transliteration":"l-fasāda","verse_key":"2:205"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢٠٥","en_gloss":"(205)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:205"}]},{"verse_key":"2:206","surah":2,"ayah":206,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُ ٱتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ أَخَذَتْهُ ٱلْعِزَّةُ بِٱلْإِثْمِ ۚ فَحَسْبُهُۥ جَهَنَّمُ ۚ وَلَبِئْسَ ٱلْمِهَادُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When he is told, ‘Beware of God,’ his arrogance leads him to sin. Hell is enough for him: a dreadful resting place.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقِ","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqi","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَخَذَتْهُ","en_gloss":"takes him","transliteration":"akhadhathu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعِزَّةُ","en_gloss":"(his) pride","transliteration":"l-ʿizatu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْإِثْمِ ۚ","en_gloss":"to [the] sins","transliteration":"bil-ith'mi","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَحَسْبُهُۥ","en_gloss":"Then enough for him","transliteration":"faḥasbuhu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) Hell ","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"[and] surely an evil","transliteration":"walabi'sa","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمِهَادُ","en_gloss":"[the] resting-place","transliteration":"l-mihādu","verse_key":"2:206"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٠٦","en_gloss":"(206)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:206"}]},{"verse_key":"2:207","surah":2,"ayah":207,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَشْرِى نَفْسَهُ ٱبْتِغَآءَ مَرْضَاتِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ رَءُوفٌۢ بِٱلْعِبَادِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But there is also a kind of man who gives his life away to please God, and God is most compassionate to His servants.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And of","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is the one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَشْرِى","en_gloss":"sells","transliteration":"yashrī","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَفْسَهُ","en_gloss":"his own self","transliteration":"nafsahu","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱبْتِغَآءَ","en_gloss":"seeking","transliteration":"ib'tighāa","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَرْضَاتِ","en_gloss":"pleasure","transliteration":"marḍāti","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَءُوفٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) full of Kindness","transliteration":"raūfun","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِٱلْعِبَادِ","en_gloss":"to His servants","transliteration":"bil-ʿibādi","verse_key":"2:207"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٠٧","en_gloss":"(207)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:207"}]},{"verse_key":"2:208","surah":2,"ayah":208,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱدْخُلُوا۟ فِى ٱلسِّلْمِ كَآفَّةً وَلَا تَتَّبِعُوا۟ خُطُوَٰتِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَكُمْ عَدُوٌّ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, enter wholeheartedly into submission to God and do not follow in Satan’s footsteps, for he is your sworn enemy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Enter","transliteration":"ud'khulū","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسِّلْمِ","en_gloss":"Islam","transliteration":"l-sil'mi","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَآفَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"completely","transliteration":"kāffatan","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَتَّبِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿū","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خُطُوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"footsteps","transliteration":"khuṭuwāti","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَدُوٌّۭ","en_gloss":"an enemy","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُّبِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"open","transliteration":"mubīnun","verse_key":"2:208"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٠٨","en_gloss":"(208)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:208"}]},{"verse_key":"2:209","surah":2,"ayah":209,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن زَلَلْتُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْكُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you slip back after clear proof has come to you, then be aware that God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":2,"ar":"زَلَلْتُم","en_gloss":"you slip","transliteration":"zalaltum","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَآءَتْكُمُ","en_gloss":"came to you","transliteration":"jāatkumu","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(from) the clear proofs","transliteration":"l-bayinātu","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"then know","transliteration":"fa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَزِيزٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Mighty","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَكِيمٌ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"2:209"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٠٩","en_gloss":"(209)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:209"}]},{"verse_key":"2:210","surah":2,"ayah":210,"ar_uthmani":"هَلْ يَنظُرُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ فِى ظُلَلٍ مِّنَ ٱلْغَمَامِ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَقُضِىَ ٱلْأَمْرُ ۚ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are these people waiting for God to come to them in the shadows of the clouds, together with the angels? But the matter would already have been decided by then: all matters are brought back to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Are","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they waiting","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"[except]","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَأْتِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"yatiyahumu","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ظُلَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) shadows","transliteration":"ẓulalin","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْغَمَامِ","en_gloss":"[the] clouds","transliteration":"l-ghamāmi","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"and the Angels","transliteration":"wal-malāikatu","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَقُضِىَ","en_gloss":"and is decreed","transliteration":"waquḍiya","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amru","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"tur'jaʿu","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_gloss":"(all) the matters","transliteration":"l-umūru","verse_key":"2:210"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٢١٠","en_gloss":"(210)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:210"}]}]}